            </rdf:Seq>
         </dc:creator>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The MAX809 and MAX810 are costâˆ’effective system supervisor&#xD;&#xA;circuits designed to monitor VCC in digital systems and provide a reset&#xD;&#xA;signal to the host processor when necessary. No external components&#xD;&#xA;are required.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
